      "side": 1,
      "message": "This check runs before `cleanText`, so a hook that leaves only comment lines (`# ...`) passes it and the commit is created with an empty message under strip cleanup. Also, if the original message was blank and the hook deletes the file, `message` is null and `CommitMsgHook` throws `IllegalStateException`. I\u0027d reject null right here and do the blank check after cleanup.",
